  locationTitle: The Unmarked Fork
  spiritName: The Lightkeeper
  leadText: The watcher's stones lead beyond the reeds to an unmarked fork. A flickering lantern is the only light on either road.
  cardArtwork: {fileID: 2800000, guid: af0ed9f1ba954df3be70282b2333aaf6, type: 3}
  beats:
  - id: causeway
    kind: 0
    title: The Unmarked Fork
    text: Beyond the reeds, the causeway meets two muddy roads. Rain and rot have taken the names from the signpost. A lantern trembles above a broken cart.
    continueLabel: Approach the lantern
    background: {fileID: 2800000, guid: af0ed9f1ba954df3be70282b2333aaf6, type: 3}
