  - id: arrival
    kind: 1
    title: A light of its own
    text: Blue light gathers along its wings. The moth settles on the cart's far rail, larger now than any creature that circled the flame.
    continueLabel: Meet the lightkeeper
    background: {fileID: 0}
    sceneLighting: {fileID: 0}
    foreground: {fileID: 0}
