  - id: bargain
    kind: 2
    title: What the light remembers
    text: Win my bargain, and I will tell you what happened at the crossing. Keep pace with the lantern. Its favor never rests.
    continueLabel: Hear the terms
    background: {fileID: 0}
    sceneLighting: {fileID: 0}
    foreground: {fileID: 0}
