  tablePresentation: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 11aef833f59245afbc56b0b313422f71, type: 2}
  victoryTitle: Across the boundary
  victoryText: Your traveler was alive. They asked me to tell anyone searching that they had crossed the old bridge. I saw them step through its far arch; the road beyond vanished. Take their message to the fox. You will need his help.
  defeatTitle: The light moves on
  defeatText: You held your gaze where the light had been. Rest a while. The roads will still be here.
  abandonText: The lightkeeper settles beside the lantern. Both roads disappear into the night.
  encounterCharmsIntroductionText: 
  resultContinueLabel: Return to the trail
  completionClueTitle: Alive beyond the boundary
  completionClueText: The moth spoke with the traveler and witnessed their crossing. Beyond the old bridge's far arch, the road vanished. Return to the fox with their message.
